            $ORIG$• Multi-well exploration campaign planned to drive further growth, starting with East Bir El-Nus (“EBEN”;  onshore Egypt) exploration drilling in Q2 2026 and then the high-impact Block 2 (offshore Greece)  exploration well, where drilling is targeted for late 2026/early 2027. • The Group is also focused on maturing other high-potential exploration targets in Egypt and Israel. • Evaluating new M&A opportunities, particularly in West Africa, to grow the business.$ORIG$,
