            $ORIG$Mathios Rigas, Chief Executive Officer of Energean, commented:   “I  am  pleased  to  report  an  excellent  fourth  quarter,  during  which  we  delivered  a  12%  year-on‑year  increase  in  production,  averaging  162  kboed for  the  quarter. This  resulted  in  full  year  production  averaging  154  kboed (113  kboed from Israel), which was at the upper end of our latest production guidance.$ORIG$,
