            '2026-03-12T12:58:22.482000+00:00',
            $TRANS$The credit facilities are intended to serve the partnership in its ongoing activities, including in connection with the expansion project of the Leviathan reservoir. In accordance with the terms of the agreement, the partnership undertook to withdraw the entire credit line A in the amount of $100 million "(credit line A)" by March 2, 2026, and it will be entitled to withdraw from credit plan B, from time to time and up to one year from the date of signing "(availability period)", up to an additional $400 million "(credit line B)". A loan that was used out of a credit line B and repaid during the availability period will be re-withdrawn until the end of the availability period.$TRANS$
