            $TRANS$The loans will bear interest that will be paid on a median basis, with the first interest payment due on June 30, 2026 and the last payment on the final repayment date. The loan from a credit line 'I will carry a fixed annual interest rate in the range of 5.45% to 5.85%. The loan from Credit Facility B will bear a variable annual interest rate on a six-month SOFR Term basis, plus a spread in the range of 2.3% to 2.4%.$TRANS$
