            $TRANS$Representations, liabilities and breach events that give the lender grounds for making the loans available for immediate repayment within the framework of the credit facility documents Certain representations of the partnership as well as additional obligations and conditions as are customary in financing agreements of this type, including certain default breach events were defined in the credit facility documents in which the lender has the right to make the loans or any part thereof available for immediate repayment, including, inter alia,  The following events: the cessation or continuous suspension of production from the Leviathan project due to war or terrorism, including by way of a regulatory directive,$TRANS$
