            $TRANS$The loans that will be utilized from the two credit facilities "(the loans)" will be repaid in unequal installments, as detailed in Section 1 below, until their final repayment on June 30, 2032 (the "Final Repayment Date").  The following is a concise description of the additional main conditions set out in the credit facility documents: 1. The principal, interest and fees of the loan fund will be repaid in 5 installments, as follows: ▪ 5% - on December 31, 2028;  ▪ 10% - on December 31 of each of the years 2029 to 2031 (inclusive); ▪ and 65% – at the final maturity date.$TRANS$
